<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia unchanged at 1.893 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia unchanged at 1.893 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia was unchanged at 1.893 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>				    January 11	   January 10</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.893		  1.893</p>
